6. CSS du viewer

.viewer {

    min-width: 0;

    min-height: 0;

    overflow: hidden;

    display: flex;

    flex-direction: column;

    background: #17202d;

    opacity: 0;

    visibility: hidden;

    transform:
        translateX(30px);

    pointer-events: none;

    transition:
        opacity 400ms ease,
        transform 400ms
        cubic-bezier(.4, 0, .2, 1),
        visibility 0s linear 400ms;

}


.viewer.open {

    opacity: 1;

    visibility: visible;

    transform:
        translateX(0);

    pointer-events: auto;

    transition:
        opacity 400ms ease,
        transform 400ms
        cubic-bezier(.4, 0, .2, 1),
        visibility 0s linear 0s;

}

Les deux animations utilisent maintenant exactement :

400ms
cubic-bezier(.4, 0, .2, 1)

Donc :

Viewer :

████████████████→

Documents :

←████████████████

se produisent simultanément.


